  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Roderic.27s_Wand\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Roderic's_Wand\">Roderic's Wand</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/edit/Template:Eternal_wand?section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Roderic&#39;s Wand\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"border-color-1\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDF solid; margin: 4px; width: 95%; --bg-color-1:#DDDDFF;--bg-color-1-dark:#626474;--bg-color-2:#EEEEFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#515366;--border-color-1:#DDDDFF;--border-color-1-dark:#626474;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" width=\"20%\"><a href=\"/page/UMD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"UMD\">UMD</a> Difficulty\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\" width=\"50%\">39\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" width=\"30%\" rowspan=\"10\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:SummonMonsterI.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/SummonMonsterI.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"60\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <br /><a href=\"/page/Summon_Unknown_Monster\" title=\"Summon Unknown Monster\">Summon Unknown Monster</a><br />\n<p>Caster Level: 7<br />\n12/12 Charges<br />\nRecharged/Day: 12\n</p>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">No <a href=\"/page/UMD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"UMD\">UMD</a> check for:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">Wiz, Sor, Clr, FvS, Brd\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Minimum Level:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Durability:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Material:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Hardness:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Weight:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Base Value:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">14,400 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Location:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Maleficent_Cabal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Maleficent Cabal\">The Maleficent Cabal</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Summon_Unknown_Monster\" title=\"Summon Unknown Monster\">Summon Unknown Monster</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Summon_Unknown_Monster\" title=\"Summon Unknown Monster\">Summon Unknown Monster</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 7<br /><b>Charges: </b>12 (12/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 12 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:12)</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Roderic%27s_Wand.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Roderic%27s_Wand.PNG/420px-Roderic%27s_Wand.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"433\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Roderic%27s_Wand.PNG 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Epic_Roderic%27s_Wand\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Epic Roderic&#39;s Wand\">Epic Roderic's Wand</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>This is the unpredictable wand <a href=\"/page/Malicia\" title=\"Malicia\">Malicia</a> gave to <a href=\"/edit/Roderic?redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Roderic (page does not exist)\">Roderic</a>, promising that it would protect him. What Roderic did not realize is that the wand recharges over time, but only if not being used.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Summoning\" title=\"Augment Summoning\">Augment Summoning</a> <b>does</b> work on creatures summoned by this wand.\n<p>When cast, it summons one creature at random from this list:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Celestial_Dog\" title=\"Celestial Dog\">Celestial Dog</a>: CR 1; Lawful Good; like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_I\" title=\"Summon Monster I\">Summon Monster I</a> spell.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Fiendish_Monstrous_Scorpion\" title=\"Fiendish Monstrous Scorpion\">Fiendish Monstrous Scorpion</a>: CR 2; immune to poison, melee, can poison on attack; like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_II\" title=\"Summon Monster II\">Summon Monster II</a> spell.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Summoned_Hellhound\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Summoned Hellhound\">Summoned Hellhound</a>: CR 4; hide, breath of fire, fireball, melee; like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_III\" title=\"Summon Monster III\">Summon Monster III</a> spell.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Fiendish_Monstrous_Spider\" title=\"Fiendish Monstrous Spider\">Fiendish Monstrous Spider</a>: CR 6; web, ranged acid damage, tremor sense; like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_IV\" title=\"Summon Monster IV\">Summon Monster IV</a> spell.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817224847\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1596/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13146/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3885/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursio