  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Eternal wand\n  | name                     = Roderic's Wand\n  | umd                      = 39\n  | noumd                    = Wiz, Sor, Clr, FvS, Brd\n  | minlevel                 = 3\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtA|BoA|1}}\n  | durability               = 25\n  | material                 = Wood\n  | hardness                 = 10\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | cost                     = 14,400 pp\n  | released                 = Update 5\n  | quest                    = The Maleficent Cabal\n  | end reward               = yes\n  | description              = This is the unpredictable wand [[Malicia]] gave to [[Roderic]], promising that it would protect him. What Roderic did not realize is that the wand recharges over time, but only if not being used.\n  | icon                     = SummonMonsterI.jpg\n  | spell                    = Summon Unknown Monster\n  | casterlvl                = 7\n  | charge                   = 12\n  | crafting                 = Epic Crafting\n  | craftingupgrade          = Epic Roderic's Wand\n  | picdesc                  = Roderic's Wand.PNG\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Clicky|Summon Unknown Monster|7|12|12}}\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | notes                    = [[Augment Summoning]] '''does''' work on creatures summoned by this wand.\n\nWhen cast, it summons one creature at random from this list:[[Category:Summons]]\n* [[Celestial Dog]]: CR 1; Lawful Good; like the [[Summon Monster I]] spell.\n* [[Fiendish Monstrous Scorpion]]: CR 2; immune to poison, melee, can poison on attack; like the [[Summon Monster II]] spell.\n* [[Summoned Hellhound]]: CR 4; hide, breath of fire, fireball, melee; like the [[Summon Monster III]] spell.\n* [[Fiendish Monstrous Spider]]: CR 6; web, ranged acid damage, tremor sense; like the [[Summon Monster IV]] spell.\n}}",
